### Analysis of Failed Expectations in Cycle Executions

Three proposals failed to meet their expected outcomes in this cycle. Each failure reveals a misalignment between the documented rules and the code's behavior, or a misreading of the rules by the proposer. Below, I dissect each failure, quote the relevant rule, identify the decisive line of code, and prescribe next steps for the proposer.

